(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[18] = {"n": 18, "title": "Gender, Number, and Noun Forms", "ar": "التَّذْكِيرُ وَالتَّأْنِيثُ وَالعَدَدُ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>Learn to move from a word's form to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> role: recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر ومؤنث</span>, form and analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى ومجموع</span>, recognise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصغير ونسبة</span>, and choose the right construction for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد ومعدود</span>. Explanations are in English; the grammatical names and final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> stay in Arabic.</p><p>Recall that a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع</span>; a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>; after a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> or in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> explains an otherwise incomplete quantity; in the number constructions taught here it is normally the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> form after 11–99. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> links a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> and removes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> or the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span>.</p><p>Keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صياغة</span> separate from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>: first decide which form expresses the intended meaning, then decide what its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> requires. The last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> might belong to the word, mark <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>, express <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نسبة</span>, or be a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>. Do not identify its function from its shape alone.</p><p>Each lesson has guided choices, unfamiliar independent examples, a brief cumulative check, and an Arabic reading check. Each question or table row has one correct answer. Where Arabic allows alternatives, the task names the intended account or asks for the complete permitted set. Predict your answer before looking at the choices.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "Recognising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المذكر والمؤنث</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule and terms</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث حقيقي</span></b> refers to what is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث بالخِلقة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة، ناقة</span></b> (woman, she-camel). <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث غير حقيقي</span></b> is treated grammatically as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> without that natural distinction: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعة، شمس</span></b>. The terms <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجازي</span></b> also describe this non-natural <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> in the classification used here. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span></b> is what lies outside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤنث</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Evidence for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span></th><th>Examples</th><th>What to notice</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء مربوطة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعة، غرفة</span></td><td>The ending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> is visible</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بُشْرى، ذِكْرى</span></td><td>An added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>, not every final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span></td><td>The ending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـاء</span> has this function here</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس، أرض، يد</span></td><td>Learn the usage even without a visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث سماعي</span></b> is recognised from established Arabic usage. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> can be seen in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصغير</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شُمَيْسَة</span></b>. This does not mean that you should write <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمسة</span> in ordinary speech. Likewise, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span></b> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤنث السماعي</span>; its final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is not automatically <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">A useful vocabulary bank</h2><p>Learn these as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> in the uses practised here: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أذن</span></b> ear, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرض</span></b> earth, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرب</span></b> war, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دار</span></b> house, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رِجْل</span></b> foot/leg, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ريح</span></b> wind, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماء</span></b> sky, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس</span></b> sun, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span></b> stick, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عين</span></b> eye, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كأس</span></b> cup, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نار</span></b> fire, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span></b> self, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يد</span></b> hand. Recognise the contrast between <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رِجْل</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَجُل</span></b> (man).</p><p>Some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> allow <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span></b>, including <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بئر، حال، دلو، ذراع، ذهب، روح، سبيل، سكين، سوق، طريق، عنق، عنكبوت، قدر، لسان، نخل</span></b>. Do not reject one of the permitted uses merely because you have learnt the other. Questions will state a chosen usage where necessary.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشَّمْسُ طَالِعَةٌ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">The sun is rising.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة، وهو مؤنث سماعي</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالعة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة، مؤنث لمطابقة الشمس</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر</span> helps you read the grammatical classification of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤنث الحقيقي ما كان مؤنثًا بالخِلقة، وغير الحقيقي ما كان في حكم المؤنث</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم</span> = treated as; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماع</span> = established usage rather than a form invented by analogy.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule and terms"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "A useful vocabulary bank"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L1-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the highlighted feature.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة مؤنث بالخِلقة؛ ساعة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة؛ بشرى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>. These are different ways of recognising <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span>.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث حقيقي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساعة</span>: visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء مربوطة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بشرى: علامة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء النسبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء مربوطة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why can <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس طالعة</span></b> be correct without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس مبتدأ مؤنث سماعي؛ طالعة خبر مرفوع يطابقه</span>. The written ending alone is not decisive.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الشمس مؤنث سماعي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم بلا تاء مذكّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالعة مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Using the bank above, complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النارُ</span> …</b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارّ</span> = hot.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النار مؤنث سماعي ومبتدأ مرفوع؛ حارّة خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النار</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارّةٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارّةٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حارٌّ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A learner rejects one use of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طريق</span></b> solely because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span> and they learnt it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>. What corrects the reasoning?", "sol": "<p>Both usages are admitted. A single-answer exercise must specify the intended usage or ask about this permission.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طريق مبني لا إعراب له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طريق مما يذكّر ويؤنّث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طريق لا يقع إلا فعلًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which conclusion is justified by <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شُمَيْسَة</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The form supports the analysis of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث سماعي</span>. It does not replace the ordinary word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس</span>.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب كتابة شمسة بدل شمس دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصغير يكشف تاء مقدّرة في شمس</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في حكم المؤنث وإن لم يكن مؤنثًا بالخِلقة</span></b> describes:", "sol": "<p>The definition concerns grammatical treatment rather than natural <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث حقيقي فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم مذكّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث غير حقيقي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموحّد والمثنّى</span>: form and role", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">One or two</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></b> (also <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span></b> here) denotes one: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمن</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span></b> denotes two: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤمنان</span></b>. Do not confuse this meaning of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> with its specialised use in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باب النداء</span>, where it means neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبيه بالمضاف</span>.</p><p>To form an ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>, give the final letter of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد فتحة</span>, then add <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">انِ</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يْنِ</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Position</th><th>Example</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمانِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت المعلّمَيْنِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمت على المعلّمَيْنِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالياء</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>. It is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الإعراب</span>. Keep the same spelling for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, and use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> to distinguish them. With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء مربوطة</span>, the ordinary form shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمتانِ / معلّمتَيْنِ</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّما المدرسةِ. رأيتُ معلّمَي المدرسةِ</span>.</b> The first is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالألف</span>; the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالياء</span>. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>, so the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> drops. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المدرسةِ</span></b> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. This deletion also applies to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Two special observations</h2><p>When two corresponding things are attached to two possessors, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> form can replace the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> to avoid combining two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنيتان</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلوبُهما</span></b> can mean the two people's hearts, one for each. Do not conclude from the form alone that each has several hearts. This usage is not an instruction to replace every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> in every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</p><p>Two lexical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> lose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُصْية</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خُصْيانِ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلْية</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلْيانِ</span></b>. Recognise these particular forms; do not extend the deletion to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَأَيْتُ مُعَلِّمَيِ المَدْرَسَةِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw the school's two teachers.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء في محل رفع فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَي</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى، حذفت نونه للإضافة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المدرسة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. In connected pronunciation the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> takes a helping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s5\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصاغ المثنّى بزيادة ألف ونون رفعًا، وياء ونون نصبًا وجرًّا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة</span> = adding; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسقط النون عند الإضافة</span> = the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> is removed in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "One or two"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Two special observations"}, {"id": "L2-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L2-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the completion.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر, نصب</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على. المثنّى</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> … (two teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمونَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمَيْنِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> … (two teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمَيْنِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمتانِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span> … (two women teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمتَيْنِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمتانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمونَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمانِ المدرسةِ</span></b> while preserving <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> and the meaning “two”.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذفت النون للإضافة. معلّما فاعل مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى؛ المدرسة مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّما المدرسةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمَيْنِ المدرسةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمو المدرسةِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بطالبَي خالدٍ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجر</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَي</span> is …", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبَي</span>, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى مضاف</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> has dropped; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span> remains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الجر</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون المحذوفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة على الدال</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In the stated usage <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلوبهما</span></b>, each of the two people has one heart. What is the correct conclusion?", "sol": "<p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> form can be used here to avoid two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنيتان</span> together. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هما علامة رفع المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يستعمل لفظ الجمع عند إضافة الشيئين إلى اثنين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يلزم أن يكون لكل واحد أكثر من قلب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين</span></b> alone insufficient to decide between <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>?", "sol": "<p>When the intended form is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى, نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> share <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء. رأيت</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span> establish different roles.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون تدل على جر دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى لا يعرب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلامة واحدة والعامل يعيّن الإعراب</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسقط نون المثنّى عند الإضافة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ مثال يحقّق ذلك؟</span>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد مضاف إليه</span>. In the other forms there is no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> requiring deletion.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمانِ جديدانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما خالدٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية المقصور والمنقوص والممدود</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Inspect the original ending</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ، هادٍ</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا، فتى، مسعى</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممدود</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> preceded by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف زائدة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساء، صحراء</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> of a letter means the letter from which the present form developed; use the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> rather than guessing it.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Type</th><th>What happens in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> form</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span> with deleted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span></td><td>Restore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هادٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاديانِ؛ قاضٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيانِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> third in the word</td><td>Restore its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل, واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصوانِ؛ فتى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتيانِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> fourth or later</td><td>Change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسعى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسعيانِ؛ ملهى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملهيانِ؛ ذكرى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكريانِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاديَيْنِ، عصوَيْنِ، فتيَيْنِ، مسعيَيْنِ</span></b>. Keep apart the restored or changed letter belonging to the stem and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> marking <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب المثنّى</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Three kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الممدود</span></h2><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span></th><th>Rule</th><th>Examples in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصلية</span></td><td>Keep it</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرّاء</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرّاءانِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقلبة عن واو أو ياء</span></td><td>Keeping it or changing it to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> is allowed</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساء</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساءانِ / كساوانِ؛ غطاء</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غطاءانِ / غطاوانِ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">للتأنيث</span></td><td>Change it to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوانِ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرّاء</span></b> here means a frequent/skilled reader, a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعّال</span>, not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع قُرّاء</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساء</span></b> is a covering/garment and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غطاء</span></b> a cover. Questions about these two accept the permitted pair as one choice, or specify which form to make.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رَأَيْتُ عَصَوَيْنِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I saw two sticks.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصوين</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> restores the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> of the third-letter <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span>; the following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span>. It is not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> ending.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الممدود الأصلية تبقى، وهمزة التأنيث تقلب واوًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تبقى</span> = remains; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقلب</span> = is changed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقلبة</span> = developed from another letter.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Inspect the original ending"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Three kinds of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة الممدود</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L3-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the supplied formation to its reason.", "sol": "<p>The three rules depend on the type and position of the final letter. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسعى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> fourth; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> third whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هادٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هاديان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ردّ ياء المنقوص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف ياء المنقوص</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب همزة التأنيث</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصوان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة واو جمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ردّ الألف الثالثة إلى أصلها الواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ألف تقلب واوًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسعى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسعيان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذف الألف بلا بدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبقاء الألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب الألف الرابعة ياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساء</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقلبة</span>. Which pair is permitted in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span>?", "sol": "<p>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة منقلبة</span>, either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبقاء الهمزة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلبها واوًا</span> is allowed. The exercise therefore asks for the pair, not one arbitrarily preferred form.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساوانِ فقط ولا يجوز كساءانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساءانِ وكساوانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساءانِ فقط ولا يجوز كساوانِ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بـ</span> …</b> using the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة التأنيث</span> changes to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span>. After <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء, صحراوين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراءانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوَيْنِ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Form the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع مثنّى</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى</span></b>, whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is fourth.", "sol": "<p>A fourth-or-later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف المقصور</span> changes to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> ending.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكريانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكروانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرىانِ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت فتيين</span></b> (two young men), what does the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> of the ending express?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به. فتيين</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى منصوب بالياء</span>; the earlier <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> restores the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف فتى</span>.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر المضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع مجموع المذكّر السالم</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن كانت الهمزة أصلية بقيت على حالها</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المثال الموافق</span>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرّاء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصلية</span> and remains. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة التأنيث</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصا</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عصوانِ من عصا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرّاءانِ من قرّاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوانِ من صحراء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\">Formation</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span></b> denotes more than two using the letters of its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سالم</span></b> preserves the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>'s basic form; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسّر</span></b> changes it internally. For the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـُونَ</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـِينَ</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تائبونَ، تائبينَ</span></b>. Unlike <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span>, its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر المعلّمونَ؛ رأيتُ المعلّمينَ؛ مررتُ بالمعلّمينَ</span>.</b> The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو، ياء، ياء</span>. At <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نون</span> drops: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو المدرسةِ، معلّمي المدرسةِ</span></b>. Do not add the extra written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> used after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجماعة</span> in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\">Check eligibility before adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ون</span></h2><p>This pattern is for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أولي العلم</span></b> in the regular usage studied here. Do not manufacture it for any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> meaning several things. The following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> patterns are excluded from this regular formation:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Excluded pattern</th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلاء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر / حمراء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سكران / سكرى</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعيل بمعنى مفعول</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جريح بمعنى مجروح</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعول بمعنى فاعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور بمعنى صابر</span></td></tr><tr><td>A form shared unchanged by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جُنُب</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Recognise <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنون، أرضون، ثبون، قلون</span></b> as transmitted exceptional forms, not permission to apply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ون</span> freely. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> they follow the relevant letter pattern. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شاذّ</span></b> here describes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> to regular formation; it does not mean that a transmitted form is to be erased as an error.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Weak endings</h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصور</span>, remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> and preserve the preceding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلَوْنَ / أعلَيْنَ</span></b>. The excluded <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span> above specifically has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث فعلاء</span>; do not extend that exclusion to every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span>.</p><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منقوص</span>, remove its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هادٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هادُونَ / هادِينَ؛ قاضٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضُونَ / قاضِينَ</span></b>. The preceding letter has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>. Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيان / قاضيين</span></b>, which retains the stem <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ مُعَلِّمُو المَدْرَسَةِ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو لأنه مجموع مذكّر سالم، حذفت نونه للإضافة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المدرسة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s5\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يصاغ هذا الجمع من فعيل بمعنى مفعول ولا من فعول بمعنى فاعل</span>.</b> The meaning restriction is part of the rule, not just the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "Formation"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "Check eligibility before adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ون</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Weak endings"}, {"id": "L4-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the regular completion.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع المجموع بالواو؛ نصبه بالياء. إضافة</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون. معلّما</span> would denote two, not the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> … (several teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمَيْنِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمِينَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمونَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> … (several teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمِينَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمونَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمانِ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر … المدرسةِ</span> (several teachers)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمونَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّما</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is “add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ون</span> to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر</span></b> as the regular rule” rejected here?", "sol": "<p>The exclusion specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span> whose <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلاء</span>. It does not ban all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفات</span> or all words on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span>.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل صفة ممنوعة من الجمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر على أفعل ومؤنثه حمراء على فعلاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر فعل ماض</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ على</span> …</b> with the regular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضين مجموع مجرور بالياء</span>; the stem <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنقوص</span> is deleted. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضيين</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span> form.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضِينَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضيَيْنِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القاضُونَ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the explanation of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأعلَوْن</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلى</span> loses its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in this formation while the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> remains before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو الجمع</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقيت ألف المقصور بعد الواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذفت فتحة ما قبل الألف وجوبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذفت ألف المقصور وبقيت فتحة ما قبلها</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What does the transmitted form <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرضون</span></b> establish?", "sol": "<p>A recognised exceptional form is retained, but it does not remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> of regular formation.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود صيغة شاذّة لا يقاس عليها كل اسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جواز جمع كل اسم بالواو والنون قياسًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أن أرضون مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعيل بمعنى مفعول</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ينطبق هنا على</span>:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جريح</span> has the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعيل/مفعول</span> relationship. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور</span> belongs to the separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعول/فاعل</span> restriction.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور بمعنى صابر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّم بمعنى من يعلّم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جريح بمعنى مجروح</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المؤنث السالم</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Form and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span></h2><p>Add <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف وتاء</span></b>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عابدة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عابدات؛ مسلمة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمات</span></b>. The original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> does not remain as a second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>: not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمتات. رفع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالضمة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالكسرة</span>.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرتِ المؤمناتُ. رأيتُ المؤمناتِ. مررتُ بالمؤمناتِ</span>.</b> The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>; its helping <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> before <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الـ</span> is not an ending of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل. المؤمنات</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> in the first, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in the second, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء</span> in the third.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">Which forms take this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>?</h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> with a corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>, use this pattern when that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span> is collected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالواو والنون</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمون / مسلمات</span></b>. For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> without a corresponding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>, the form studied here includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حائضة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حائضات</span></b>. Do not infer that the bare form <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حائض</span></b> must simply receive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ات</span>; its recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> includes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُيَّض</span></b>.</p><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> is not governed by these particular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة شروط</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندات</span></b>. Therefore “the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> must visibly end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span>” is not a complete rule. This formation lesson does not license inventing any desired lexical <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> when established usage supplies another.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَكْرَمْتُ مُسْلِمَاتٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I honoured Muslim women.</span></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلماتٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة لأنه مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> does not make it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمتُ مسلمةً</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يصاغ مجموع المؤنث السالم بزيادة ألف وتاء، وينصب بالكسرة</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صياغة</span> explains how the word is formed; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> explains its ending in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Form and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "Which forms take this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>?"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L5-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the stated position.", "sol": "<p>The same form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤمناتِ</span> appears in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. Only the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and relationship distinguish them.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت المؤمنات: المؤمنات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكرمت المؤمنات: المؤمنات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالمؤمنات: المؤمنات</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct the formation <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمتات</span></b> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمة</span>.", "sol": "<p>The original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> is removed before adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ات. مسلمون</span> corresponds to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمتان</span> denotes two.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمات</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمون</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ على عابدات</span>…</b> with the correct ending.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر؛ عابدات اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The form remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عابداتَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عابداتٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عابداتٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندات</span></b> show about this formation?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span> governed by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> just discussed. A visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> is not universally required.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم آخره دال فعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندات مجموع مذكّر سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس وجود تاء في الموحّد شرطًا عامًّا في كل اسم</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ مسلماتٍ</span></b>, why does the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> not mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>?", "sol": "<p>The role is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; the family supplies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكسرة</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة النصب</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل تنوين دليل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت يقتضي مفعولًا به منصوبًا وعلامته هنا الكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمات مبني على الكسر</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة ألف وتاء</span></b> concerns which question first?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زيادة</span> describes formation. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> is still needed to determine <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هل كل منصوب يحمل فتحة؟</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف يصاغ المجموع؟</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">من الفاعل في كل جملة؟</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع المكسّر: القلّة والكثرة</span>", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Recognise a changed form</h2><p>In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكسّر</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> changes: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال، كتاب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span></b>. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي</span> family, recognised usage determines the form: learn <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكع</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رُكَّع</span></b> rather than manufacture a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>. Here the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكع</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي</span> despite the added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>. Patterns for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير الثلاثي</span> include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعالل وفعاليل</span></b>, as in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلسلة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلاسل؛ قرطاس</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراطيس</span></b>. These are pattern guides, not a reason to ignore a word's established form.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\">Four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع قلّة</span></b> expresses three through ten in the contrast below; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع كثرة</span></b> expresses more than ten. The four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية القلّة</span> are:</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span></th><th>Example</th><th>Recognition cue</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفْعال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثوب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أثواب</span></td><td>Often from a three-letter <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفْعُل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس</span></td><td>Often from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعْل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفْعِلَة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متاع</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمتعة؛ ذليل</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أذلّة</span></td><td>Often a four-letter form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span> before its end</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِعْلَة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتية</span></td><td>Learn the supplied form</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غالبًا</span></b> means often, not without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> is a recognition tool, not a grammatical role: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل، مفعول به</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> in different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\">Essential <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية الكثرة</span></h2><p>Read the vowelled <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> beside its example. The table is a recognition bank; do not assume that every word resembling a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> has only that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span></th><th>Mapped examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعْل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حُمْر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعُل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صُبُر؛ كتاب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُتُب؛ عمود</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عُمُد؛ سرير</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُرُر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غُرَف؛ كبرى</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كُبَر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِعَل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيرة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سِيَر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَلَة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُضاة</span>, with change in the final weak letter</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَلَة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساحر</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَحَرَة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعْلى</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قتيل</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَتْلى</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَّل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راكع</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رُكَّع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعّال</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طُلّاب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعول</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلوب؛ علم</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علوم؛ برج</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بروج</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِعْلان</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غلام</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غِلْمان؛ جرذ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جِرْذان؛ حوت</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حِيتان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعْلان</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قضيب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قُضْبان؛ ذكر</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذُكْران</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَلاء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فقير</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُقَراء</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَفاعيل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسطورة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساطير</span></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> behind the numerical distinction</h2><p>When a word has both forms, distinguish them: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس / نفوس</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نفس</span>. If it does not have separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كثرة</span> forms, its available pattern can serve both. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقلام</span></b> is therefore not restricted to ten pens merely because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>. Do not turn the recognition table into an absolute count limit.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ كُتُبًا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة؛ جمع مكسّر على فُعُل، موحّده كتاب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> and the grammatical role answer different questions.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s6\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن لم يكن للموحّد مجموع قلّة وكثرة، دلّ الوزن الموجود على القلّة والكثرة</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إن لم يكن</span> = if there is not; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموجود</span> = the available one.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Recognise a changed form"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "Four <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّة</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "Essential <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية الكثرة</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> behind the numerical distinction"}, {"id": "L6-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s6", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the form to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span>.", "sol": "<p>All three are among <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أبنية القلّة</span>. The fourth is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعُل</span>, as in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أنفس</span>.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أثواب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعول</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمتعة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعُل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِعلة</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِتية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فِعلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَلاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعّال</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which explanation of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقلام</span></b> is correct here?", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلّة/كثرة</span> contrast is qualified by whether both forms exist. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقلام</span> is the example of an available form serving both.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هو مثنّى منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يدل على القلّة والكثرة لعدم وجود الصيغتين المنفصلتين في هذا المثال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمتنع أن يدل على أكثر من عشرة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Using the supplied bank, choose the recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرف</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَل</span>. The task uses the supplied lexical form rather than treating <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> as free invention.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غُرُوف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أغارف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غُرَف</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلّل</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلوبًا</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت قلوبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلوب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع قلب</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعول</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> belongs to the pattern; it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع مجموع المذكّر السالم</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو، مجموع مذكّر سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة، موحّد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، جمع مكسّر على فعول</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صُبُر</span></b> useful after Lesson 4?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صبور بمعنى صابر</span> is excluded from the regular <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> but has the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر صُبُر</span>.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صُبُر مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع من الجمع بالواو والنون لا يمنع الجمع المكسّر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل صبور يجمع بالواو والنون قياسًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغالب أن يكون</span></b> in a pattern rule means:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غالب</span> marks a tendency. It must not be silently upgraded to an exceptionless rule.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا شائع وليس شرطًا بلا استثناء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمتنع كل مثال آخر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب بناء كل اسم على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الجمع واسم الجنس الجمعي</span> and reference", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\">Three different accounts of “more than one”</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Relationship to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></th><th>Example</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span></td><td>Formed using its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>'s letters, with a change <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لفظي</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل / رجال</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جمع</span></td><td>No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> of the same lexical form</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوم، رهط</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جنس جمعي</span></td><td>One is distinguished by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمر / تمرة؛ روم / روميّ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The form <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُلْك</span></b> can refer to one ship or several ships. In the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> use, the change is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span></b>, not a visible change of spelling. Context, rather than the ending alone, determines which is meant.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span> with collective meaning</h2><p>The classification of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المؤنث</span> includes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> forms other than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> when treated as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جماعة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أورقت الشجر؛ كذّبت قومُ نوحٍ؛ تلك الرسل</span></b>. This allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> by the collective meaning; it does not mean that the individual referents must be women, or that every alternative <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> is forbidden.</p><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الجنس الجمعي</span></b>, both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span> are allowed. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نخلٍ منقعرٍ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نخلٍ خاويةٍ</span></b>: the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> in one permitted account and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> in the other. Do not force a single answer where the intended account is unspecified.</p><p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span> referring to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span>, <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث مع الإفراد</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث مع الجمع</span></b> can be used in the account studied here. The stated preference associates <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإفراد</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع القلّة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع الكثرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span></b> means preferred, not obligatory. The choice may also reflect which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموعة</span> is intended: distinguish a whole collection of months from a specified four within it. Exercises test the permission and distinction, not an invented universal <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نهي</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span></h2><p>The term <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span></b> is used here for a further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلاب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكاليب</span></b>. This is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسموع لا يقاس عليه</span></b>: recognise the transmitted sequence without generating similar forms for every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>. Do not infer a new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> rule merely from that label.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s4\">Naming a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span></h2><p>Both <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء تجرّ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء يجرّ</span></b> can be explained: the first estimates <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلمة الباء</span></b>; the second <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف الباء</span></b>. This applies when speaking about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حروف</span> and their names. The implied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلمة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span> explains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البَاءُ تَجُرُّ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تجرّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع مرفوع بالضمة، وفاعله ضمير مستتر تقديره هي يعود إلى الباء على تقدير كلمة؛ الجملة في محل رفع خبر</span>. The word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> is being named and discussed here.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s6\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الجنس الجمعي يفرّق بينه وبين موحّده بالتاء أو الياء</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفرّق</span> = distinguishes; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يقاس عليه</span> = do not extend it by analogy.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "Three different accounts of “more than one”"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span> with collective meaning"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s4", "title": "Naming a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s6", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عيّن القسم في الأمثلة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوم اسم جمع. تمرة</span> distinguishes one from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمر بالتاء</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">روميّ</span> distinguishes one from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">روم بالياء</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قوم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مؤنث سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمر / تمرة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مذكّر سالم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جمع لا موحّد له من لفظه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جنس جمعي يفرّق بالتاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">روم / روميّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى يرفع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع على أفعلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم جنس جمعي يفرّق بالياء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why can <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فلك</span></b> require context to classify?", "sol": "<p>The distinction can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري</span>. A visible change of letters is not required in every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود الكاف يوجب الجمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل فلك مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قد يستعمل للواحد والجمع مع عدم تغيّر اللفظ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الحكم في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم الجنس الجمعي</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في الاستعمال المدروس</span>.", "sol": "<p>Both accounts are allowed, as illustrated with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نخل</span>. An exercise must not mark a permitted alternative wrong without specifying its scope.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب التذكير دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب التأنيث دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز فيه التذكير والتأنيث</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كيف تفسّر</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء يجرّ</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>, yielding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير. الباء تجرّ</span> instead uses the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقدير كلمة</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على تقدير حرف الباء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء هنا فعل أمر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن كلمة الباء مؤنثة وجوبًا في كل استعمال</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ما نتيجة</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسموع لا يقاس عليه</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في أكاليب؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The supplied further <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> is retained, but not extended indiscriminately.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نرفض أكاليب مع ورودها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحفظ الصيغة ولا ننشئ على مثالها جمعًا لكل جمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نحوّل كل مجموع إلى أكاليب</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث مع الإفراد والتأنيث مع الجمع جائزان</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعني</span>:", "sol": "<p>Permission and preference are different judgements. The account admits both forms of reference in its stated scope.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يجوز أي ضمير مؤنث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يحوّل الترجيح أحد الوجهين إلى ممتنع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ضمير جمع يجب أن يكون هو</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصغير والنسبة</span>", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\">Necessary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> vocabulary</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صيغة / بناء الكلمة</span></b> means the word's form; here <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> is not the opposite of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span></b> represents the pattern using <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ف ع ل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي، رباعي، خماسي</span></b> in these rules refer to the letter count of the form being treated. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span></b> is a lengthening <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف، واو</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> in the appropriate vowel setting.</p><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصغير</span></b> changes a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span>'s form to express smallness. Read the three patterns with their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركات</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Applied to</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نجم</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نُجَيْم</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رباعي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خماسي</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span> just before the last letter</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهم</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دُرَيْهِم؛ سفرجل</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُفَيْرِج</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِيل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خماسي</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span> just before the last letter</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُفَيْتِيح</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهم</span></b> is a coin; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سفرجل</span></b> a quince; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح</span></b> a key. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سفرجل</span> → <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سفيرج</span> the last original letter is omitted to obtain the taught pattern. Do not preserve all five letters mechanically. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح, ألف</span> becomes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> of the longer pattern. Compare the restored <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شمس</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شميسة</span></b>, already used as evidence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث سماعي</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة</span></b> attaches a <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء مشدّدة</span></b> to relate a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> to something: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span></b>. Remove the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> in this example and add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـيّ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المتكلم</span> and does not itself mean “my.” <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span></b> is a word meaning related to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابي</span></b> can instead be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مضاف إلى ياء المتكلم</span>.</p><p>This introductory rule supplies the meaning and basic construction. Do not assume that every geographical name can be converted by unaltered addition; use the forms taught here.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هَذَا رَجُلٌ مَكِّيٌّ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم إشارة مبني على السكون في محل رفع مبتدأ</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خبر مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مرفوع بالضمة؛ الياء المشدّدة للنسبة، وليست ضميرًا في محل جر</span>. The word still takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> after formation.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة إلحاق ياء مشدّدة في آخر الاسم لنسبته إلى شيء</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق</span> = attaching; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لنسبته</span> = to express its relationship.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "Necessary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> vocabulary"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصغير</span> to its pattern.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نجم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">درهم رباعي</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح خماسي</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span> before its last letter.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نُجَيْم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِيل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دُرَيْهِم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِيل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مُفَيْتِيح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْعِيل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فُعَيْل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which reason distinguishes the pattern of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سفرجل</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>Both forms have five letters in this treatment, but only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفتاح</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف مد</span> just before the final letter.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود تاء التأنيث في سفرجل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وجود حرف مد قبل آخر مفتاح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كون مفتاح مثنّى</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصغير</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سفرجل</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعيعل</span> form omits the final original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام. سفارج</span> is not the supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصغير</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُفَيْرِجِل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَفَارِج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سُفَيْرِج</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت رجلًا مكّيًّا</span></b>, analyse <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيًّا</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء المشددة</span> is part of formation, not an attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالياء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بياء المتكلم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت منصوب بالفتحة، والياء للنسبة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why must “every final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> means my” be corrected?", "sol": "<p>Compare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ, كتابي</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعلّمين</span>. Form and context distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة، الضمير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الإعراب</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الياء قد تكون للنسبة أو غيرها، ويحدّد التركيب وظيفتها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ياء للنسبة فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل ياء علامة تثنية</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلحاق ياء مشدّدة</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في تعريف النسبة يوافق</span>:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span> expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النسبة. نجيم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تصغير</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيان</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نجم</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نجيم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيان</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "9", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد</span>: families, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنان</span>", "short": "Lesson 9", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s1\">Classify the expression first</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span></b> states how many; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span></b> is what is counted. Keep three questions separate: the form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد</span>, its relation to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير وتأنيث المعدود</span>, and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of both.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Family</th><th>Forms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد المفرد: الآحاد</span> in this classification</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد، اثنان، ثلاث … عشر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد المفرد: العشرات</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون، ثلاثون، أربعون، خمسون، ستون، سبعون، ثمانون، تسعون</span></td></tr><tr><td>Other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مفرد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة، ألف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب مزج</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تسعة عشر</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب عطف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد وعشرون، سبع وعشرون</span>; also combinations such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف ومائة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Here <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مفرد</span></b> describes construction, not a value of one: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> are also <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مفرد</span>. The labels for numbers and for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد/مثنّى/مجموع</span> answer different questions.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s2\">Order of components</h2><p>In the combinations studied here, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span> precedes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآحاد</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآحاد</span> precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العشرات</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف ومائة سنة؛ مائة وأربع سنوات؛ سبع وعشرون ليلة</span></b>. Identify the component next to the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> before applying the detailed ending rules.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد واثنان: مطابقة</span></h2><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنان</span> <b>match</b> their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span>. In the basic construction they follow it as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span></b>:</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ واحدٌ؛ امرأةٌ واحدةٌ؛ رجلانِ اثنانِ؛ امرأتانِ اثنتانِ</span>.</b></div><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>; that of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنان</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ رجلًا واحدًا؛ مررتُ بامرأتينِ اثنتينِ</span></b>. In larger numbers the corresponding forms still match, but do not automatically analyse the first component as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> to the later <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَتِ امْرَأَتَانِ اثْنَتَانِ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض، والتاء للتأنيث</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأتان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف لأنه مثنّى</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنتان</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مرفوع بالألف، يطابق المنعوت في التأنيث. نون المثنّى</span> is not the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة الرفع</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L9-s5\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يطابق واحد واثنان معدودهما مفردًا ومركّبًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يطابق</span> = matches; the next lessons contrast <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يخالف</span> = differs.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L9-s1", "title": "Classify the expression first"}, {"id": "L9-s2", "title": "Order of components"}, {"id": "L9-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد واثنان: مطابقة</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L9-s5", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "9G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Classify the number construction.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفرد</span> here refers to the construction. It does not mean the value must be one.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب مزج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب عطف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب مزج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مفرد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب عطف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبع وعشرون</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب عطف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب مزج</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "9G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ امرأةً</span> …</b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحدة نعت منصوب بالفتحة</span>, matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأةً</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "9G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحدةٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحدةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحدًا</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ على رجلينِ</span> …</b> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنان</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنين نعت مجرور بالياء</span>, matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلين</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنتينِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنينِ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "9I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which sequence follows the taught order for 27 nights?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الآحاد</span> precede <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العشرات</span> in this construction: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبع وعشرون. ليلة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, so the unit is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبع</span>.</p>", "group": "9I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون وسبع ليلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبع وعشرون ليلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبعون وعشر ليلة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلٌ واحدٌ</span></b>, which role belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span>?", "sol": "<p>In this basic construction, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> comes first and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد</span> follows it as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>. Its precise <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> follows the position of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span>.</p>", "group": "9R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "9-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد واثنان يطابقان المعدود</span></b> selects which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>?", "sol": "<p>The corresponding form for two women is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنتان</span>, matching <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأتان</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأتان اثنتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة واحد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأتان اثنان</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "10", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة إلى عشرة: مخالفة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "short": "Lesson 10", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s1\">Opposite form, based on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></h2><p>For 3–10 as standalone numbers, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يخالف المعدود</span></b> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span>. With a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر معدود</span>, use the form with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span>; with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, use the form without it:</p><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ رجالٍ؛ أربعُ نساءٍ؛ خمسةُ كتبٍ؛ ستُّ غرفٍ</span>.</b></div><p>Determine this from the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span></b>, not the appearance of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>, hence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة كتب</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, hence <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ست غرف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حِجّة</span></b> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, so <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربعُ حِجَجٍ</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربعة حجج</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s2\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مجرور</span></h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></b> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> itself changes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> with its role:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Context</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر ثلاثةُ رجالٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع، وهو مضاف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال مضاف إليه مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت ثلاثةَ رجالٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب، وهو مضاف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال مضاف إليه مجرور</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بثلاثةِ رجالٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء، وهو مضاف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال مضاف إليه مجرور</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Do not add <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ رجالٍ</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةٌ رجالٍ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> stays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> even when the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s3\">The sound of ten</h2><p>Standalone <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَشْرُ نساءٍ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شين ساكنة</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَشَرَةُ رجالٍ</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شين مفتوحة</span>. Inside 11–19 the corresponding forms reverse this detail: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَشَرَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَشْرَةَ</span></b>. The next lesson explains which form belongs with which <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s4\">A boundary case: omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span></h2><p>If the intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is omitted, retaining the usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span> and omitting it for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span> is preferred: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صمتُ خمسةً</span></b> intending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيام</span>; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قمتُ خمسًا</span></b> intending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليال</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صمتُ خمسًا</span></b> is also permitted with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيام</span> understood. Thus a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> about an omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> must distinguish <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأرجح</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجائز</span></b>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ خَمْسَةَ كُتُبٍ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء الفاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة</span> is selected because the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد كتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر. كتب</span> is not independently <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> here.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L10-s6\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العبرة في تذكير العدد وتأنيثه بالموحّد لا بالمجموع</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العبرة بـ</span> = the deciding consideration is.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L10-s1", "title": "Opposite form, based on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s2", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مجرور</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s3", "title": "The sound of ten"}, {"id": "L10-s4", "title": "A boundary case: omitted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L10-s6", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "10G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span> using the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>.", "sol": "<p>Use the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير أو تأنيث</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب، غرفة، حجّة</span>. With 3–10 the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> takes the opposite form.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مذكّر؛</span> five books", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمس كتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة كتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة كتاب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غرفة مؤنث؛</span> six rooms", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ست غرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ست غرفة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ستة غرف</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجّة مؤنث؛</span> four years", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع حجّة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع حجج</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربعة حجج</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "10G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ثلاثةَ</span> …</b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال مضاف إليه مجرور</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span> does not transfer to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p>", "group": "10G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجالًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ ثلاثةً كتبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة مفعول به منصوب ومضاف</span>, so no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين. كتب مضاف إليه مجرور. كتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر</span>, requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ ثلاثةَ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ ثلاثةُ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ ثلاثَ كتبٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود أيام محذوف في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صمتُ</span> …</b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الحكم الذي يحفظ الترجيح والجواز</span>.", "sol": "<p>With omitted intended <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيام</span>, retaining <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> is preferred, but omission is also admitted. This <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span> is not applied indiscriminately to an expressed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p>", "group": "10I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسًا واجبة وخمسةً ممتنعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسةً وحدها جائزة وخمسًا ممتنعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسةً أرجح، وخمسًا جائز</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "10R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بخمسة رجال</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">، أيّ تحليل صحيح؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> is governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is governed by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجروران</span> for different reasons.</p>", "group": "10R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة مجرور بالباء وهو مضاف؛ رجال مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجال تمييز منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خمسة مفعول به؛ رجال فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "10-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العبرة بالموحّد لا بالمجموع</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يفسّر</span>:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجّة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, so four uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span> spelling is not the deciding factor.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربعة حجج لأن حجج بلا تاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل مجموع يعامل معاملة المذكر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع حجج لأن موحّد حجج حجّة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "11", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر إلى تسعة وتسعين</span>", "short": "Lesson 11", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s1\">Build the number, then analyse the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span></h2><p>For 11–99, including the exact <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العشرات</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد منصوب على التمييز</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحدَ عشرَ رجلًا؛ عشرونَ رجلًا؛ ثلاثٌ وعشرونَ امرأةً</span></b>. Do not carry the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع مجرور</span> rule of 3–10 into this range.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Range</th><th>Rule for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span></th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>11</td><td>Both parts match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر رجلًا؛ إحدى عشرة امرأةً</span></td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>Both parts match <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا عشر رجلًا؛ اثنتا عشرة امرأةً</span></td></tr><tr><td>13–19</td><td>First part differs; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر/عشرة</span> matches <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة عشر رجلًا؛ ثلاث عشرة امرأةً</span></td></tr><tr><td>20–90</td><td>The tens form does not change for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير/تأنيث</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون رجلًا؛ عشرون امرأةً</span></td></tr><tr><td>21–99 with unit 1 or 2</td><td>The unit matches</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحد وعشرون رجلًا؛ اثنتان وعشرون امرأةً</span></td></tr><tr><td>21–99 with unit 3–9</td><td>The unit differs</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة وعشرون رجلًا؛ ثلاث وعشرون امرأةً</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>For 13–19 the two parts therefore differ <b>from each other</b>, while the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر</span> part matches <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ عَشْرَةَ امرأةً</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ عَشَرَ رجلًا</span></b> show both the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> choice and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شين</span> vowel.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span></h2><p>11 and 13–19 are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على فتح الجزأين</span></b>; their <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> follows the role: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر ثلاثةَ عشرَ رجلًا</span></b> has the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع فاعل</span>. Those <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, not evidence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p><p>12 is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>: the first part follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر/عشرة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر اثنا عشرَ رجلًا؛ رأيتُ اثني عشرَ رجلًا؛ مررتُ باثنتي عشرةَ امرأةً</span></b>. Its usual <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى نون</span> is absent in this compound.</p><p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العشرات</span> take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب وجر</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب العطف</span>, each side has the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر ثلاثةٌ وعشرونَ رجلًا؛ رأيتُ ثلاثةً وعشرينَ رجلًا؛ مررتُ بثلاثةٍ وعشرينَ رجلًا</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> between the words is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو</span> inside <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة رفع</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبًا</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span> throughout.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حَضَرَ ثَلَاثَةٌ وَعِشْرُونَ رَجُلًا</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الواو</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف مرفوع بالواو، ملحق بمجموع المذكّر السالم</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب بالفتحة</span>. Neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا</span> in this construction.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L11-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود أحد عشر إلى تسعة وتسعين موحّد منصوب على التمييز</span>.</b> Apply the ending to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> independently of the number's own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L11-s1", "title": "Build the number, then analyse the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L11-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "11G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Complete with the specified number.", "sol": "<p>11 matches in both parts. In 13, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span> differs from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر</span> matches it. In 23, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث</span> differs from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون</span> is unchanged.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "11 women", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحدى عشرة امرأةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحد عشر امرأةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إحدى عشر نساءٍ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "13 men", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة عشر رجلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة عشرة رجالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث عشر رجلًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "23 women", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث وعشرون نساءٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة وعشرون امرأةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث وعشرون امرأةً</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "11G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ … رجلًا</span></b> with 12.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثني</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> form for a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر معدود. عشر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا تمييز منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "11G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا عشرَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنتي عشرةَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثني عشرَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلّل العدد في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر خمسةَ عشرَ طالبًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>. The visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتح</span> belongs to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>; the complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل رفع. طالبًا تمييز منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بالفتحة لأنه مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالإضافة إلى طالبًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على فتح الجزأين في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "11I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الضبط الصحيح في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بثلاثة وعشرين رجلًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة مجرور بالباء؛ عشرين معطوف مجرور بالياء؛ رجلًا تمييز منصوب</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> does not become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>.</p>", "group": "11I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بثلاثةَ وعشرونَ رجلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بثلاثةٍ وعشرينَ رجلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بثلاثةٍ وعشرينَ رجالٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر عشرون رجلًا</span></b> keep <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجلًا منصوبًا</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> have different roles. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون فاعل مرفوع بالواو؛ رجلًا تمييز منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "11R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن حضر ينصب فاعله</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأنه تمييز، وإن كان العدد فاعلًا مرفوعًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لأن رجلًا مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "11-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يخالف الجزء الأول الثاني في ثلاثة عشر إلى تسعة عشر</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المثال الموافق</span>.", "sol": "<p>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة: ثلاث</span> lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء, عشرة</span> has it. The two parts differ; the second matches the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ عشرَ امرأةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ عشرةَ امرأةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ عشرةَ امرأةً</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"key": "12", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وألف</span>: choosing the whole analysis", "short": "Lesson 12", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s1\">The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></h2><p>With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد مجرور على الإضافة</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ رجلٍ؛ ألفُ امرأةٍ</span></b>. These forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد</span> do not change for the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>. The written <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span> does not create separate forms for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود مذكّر ومؤنث</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Context</th><th>Analysis</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر مائةُ رجلٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة فاعل مرفوع بالضمة ومضاف؛ رجل مضاف إليه</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت مائةَ رجلٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة ومضاف؛ رجل مضاف إليه</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بألفِ رجلٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مجرور بالباء ومضاف؛ رجل مضاف إليه</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The count word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> according to its role. “A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> comes after it” is not a reason to call it <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s2\">A compact decision sequence</h2><ol><li>Identify the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد: مفرد، مركّب مزج</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب عطف</span>.</li><li>Recover the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>'s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير/تأنيث</span> where the count changes form.</li><li>Select the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> form: 1 <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>; 2 <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنّى</span>; 3–10 <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>; 11–99 <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وألف موحّد</span>.</li><li>Select its relationship: 1–2 ordinarily have the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> after the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>; 3–10 and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وألف</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; 11–99 use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>.</li><li>Find the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span>'s own role and express its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. Do not copy the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>'s ending onto it.</li></ol><p>In larger <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معطوف</span> counts, preserve the order and immediate relationship taught by the examples: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفٌ ومائةُ سنةٍ؛ مائةٌ وأربعُ سنواتٍ؛ سبعٌ وعشرونَ ليلةً</span></b>. The final stated component determines the shown form of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> here. Do not flatten all three into one rule just because each counts years or nights.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قَرَأْتُ مِائَةَ كِتَابٍ</span>.</b></div><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة، وهو مضاف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة، موحّد</span>. Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ عشرين كتابًا</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرين مفعول به منصوب بالياء؛ كتابًا تمييز منصوب</span>.</p></div><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L12-s4\">Arabic reading</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقع معدود مائة وألف مضافًا إليه، ويكون موحّدًا</span>.</b> You should now recognise the grammatical instruction without translating each term into English.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L12-s1", "title": "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>"}, {"id": "L12-s2", "title": "A compact decision sequence"}, {"id": "L12-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L12-s4", "title": "Arabic reading"}], "items": [{"id": "12G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Select the complete <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبه جملة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وألف</span> take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد مضاف إليه مجرور. عشرون</span> takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد تمييز منصوب</span>; its own <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالياء</span>.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "100 books after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةَ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةَ كتابٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "1000 men after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بـ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفِ رجلٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفِ رجالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفَ رجلًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "20 books after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرينَ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرونَ كتابٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرينَ كتابًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "12G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة امرأةٍ</span></b> not require a new number form?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>, like <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العشرات</span>, do not alternate their form according to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير أو تأنيث</span> of the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span>.</p>", "group": "12G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة لا تتغيّر لتذكير المعدود وتأنيثه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">امرأة مذكّر دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل عدد يطابق المعدود بزيادة تاء</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "12I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ألفًا رجلًا</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مفعول به منصوب ومضاف</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> is removed. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل مضاف إليه موحّد مجرور</span>.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ألفَ رجالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ألفُ رجلٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ألفَ رجلٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "12I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر المعدود في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةٌ وأربعُ</span> …</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسب التركيب المدروس</span>.", "sol": "<p>The final component <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> to a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع: سنواتٍ</span>. It follows the supplied form <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة وأربع سنوات</span>.</p>", "group": "12I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنواتٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنةً</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سنواتٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "12R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أيّ تحليل يجمع الحكمين في</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت مائة كتاب</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؟</span>", "sol": "<p>The count has the role of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span>; its following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد مضاف إليه</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "12R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة مفعول به منصوب؛ كتاب مضاف إليه مجرور موحّد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة مبني في محل رفع؛ كتاب تمييز منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائة فاعل؛ كتاب نعت مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "12-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود مائة وألف موحّد مجرور</span></b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يوافق</span>:", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابٍ</span> is both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موحّد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور. كتب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفُ كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفُ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألفُ كتابٍ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Begin with the relationships; then justify every ending. In connected passages, track the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمائر</span> across <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمل</span>.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the formation under the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تثنية المنقوص</span> restores <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ياء</span>; its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع المذكّر السالم</span> deletes it. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة تأنيث صحراء</span> becomes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واو. نصب مجموع المؤنث السالم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالكسرة</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ: مثنّى مرفوع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضونَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيَيْنِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضٍ: مجموع مذكّر سالم مرفوع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضيانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضينَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قاضونَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء: مثنّى مرفوع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوينِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراوانِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراءانِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمة: مجموع منصوب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلماتٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلماتٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مسلمتاتٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the correction that preserves both the count and grammatical role: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمون المدرسةِ</span></b>. Several teachers are intended.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون تحذف للإضافة؛ الواو تبقى علامة رفع مجموع المذكّر السالم. معلّما</span> changes the count to two; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمي</span> is not the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span> form.</p>", "group": "A|Endings and corrections", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّما المدرسةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمو المدرسةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر معلّمي المدرسةِ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضرت معلّمتان. قرأت إحداهما ثلاثة كتب. وقرأت الأخرى ثلاث عشرة قصة</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب مذكّر وقصّة مؤنث</span>. Select the endings and relationships.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمتان فاعل مثنّى</span>. In the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة إحداهما</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به ومضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبٍ مضاف إليه</span>. In the third <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الأخرى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث عشرة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على فتح الجزأين في محل نصب مفعول به؛ قصةً تمييز</span>. The count follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تذكير أو تأنيث</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتاب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قصّة</span>, respectively.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمتان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالواو</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة كتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ كتبٍ: مفعول به ومضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةُ كتبًا: فاعل وتمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ كتبٍ: مفعول به ومضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاث عشرة قصة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ عشرةَ قصّةً: عدد في محل نصب وتمييز منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةَ عشرةَ قصّةٍ: إضافة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثَ عشرَ قصصٍ: إضافة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا رجل مكي. معه عشرون كتابًا ومائة قلم. أعطى الطفلَ قلمًا واحدًا</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قلم مذكّر</span>. Complete the specified analyses.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هذا مبتدأ؛ رجل خبر؛ مكّيّ نعت. معه ظرف متعلق بخبر مقدّم؛ عشرون مبتدأ مؤخّر مرفوع بالواو، كتابًا تمييز؛ مائة معطوف مرفوع ومضاف، قلم مضاف إليه. أعطى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مستتر هو يعود إلى الرجل؛ الطفل مفعول به أول؛ قلمًا مفعول به ثان؛ واحدًا نعت له</span>.</p>", "group": "B|Connected reading", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكي</span> in the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيٌّ: نعت مرفوع والياء للنسبة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيٍّ: مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكّيَّ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون كتابًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون مبتدأ مؤخّر؛ كتابًا تمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون فعل؛ كتابًا خبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشرون فاعل؛ كتابًا مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ومائة قلم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةٌ قلمًا: تمييز</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ قلمٍ: معطوف مرفوع ومضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةَ أقلامٍ: مفعول به</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واحدًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت منصوب لقلمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ ثلاثةَ عشرَ طالبًا</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p>The entire <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل نصب. طالبًا</span> is a separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. The first number part differs from the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مذكّر طالب</span>, while <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عشر</span> matches it. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجملة ابتدائية لا محل لها</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأى في رأيتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مرفوع</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف تأنيث لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثة عشر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد مبني على فتح الجزأين في محل نصب مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف ومضاف إليه مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طالبًا</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور، مجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب بالفتحة، موحّد</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالألف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بمعلّمَي خالدٍ</span>.</b> Exactly two teachers are intended.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل. الباء</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَي: مجرور بالياء، حذفت نونه للإضافة؛ خالدٍ مضاف إليه. الجار والمجرور متعلقان بمررت</span>. The specified meaning prevents confusing it with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع معلّمي</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض وتاء في محل رفع فاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبتدأ وخبر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع وضمير مجرور</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف عطف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معلّمَي</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرفوع بالواو لأنه مجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالياء لأنه مثنّى، وهو مضاف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالكسرة لأنه موحّد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز منصوب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الحكم الذي يحفظ الشرط أو الاستثناء</span>.", "sol": "<p>Each case contains a permission or qualification. Do not turn a preference, typical pattern, or common form into an absolute ban.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كساء، همزته منقلبة، عند التثنية</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز إبقاء الهمزة وقلبها واوًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمتنع إبقاء الهمزة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب حذف الهمزة بلا بدل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أقلام في المثال المدروس</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس جمعًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يدل على القلّة والكثرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يتجاوز عشرة أبدًا</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صمت خمسًا، والمعدود أيام محذوف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دليل على أن أيام مؤنث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جائز وإن كان خمسةً أرجح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممتنع في كل استعمال</span>"], "ans": 1}]}]}, {"id": "D2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أكمل بحسب العدد والموقع</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثني</span> follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب المثنّى</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابًا</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تمييز. ثلاثة فاعل مرفوع؛ عشرون معطوف مرفوع؛ رجلًا تمييز. مائة مفعول به ومضاف؛ كتاب مضاف إليه موحّد</span>. Establish all three: number form, number role, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> relationship.</p>", "group": "D|Cumulative distinctions", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span> … (12 books)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثني عشرَ كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنا عشرَ كتابًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اثنتي عشرةَ كتابًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> … (23 men)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثٌ وعشرونَ رجلًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةً وعشرينَ رجالٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثةٌ وعشرونَ رجلًا</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأت</span> … (100 books)", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةَ كتابٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةَ كتبٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مائةُ كتابًا</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>Can you justify the form as well as the ending? Check that you can distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سماعي</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قياسي, جائز</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">راجح</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المعدود</span>. In full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>, identify each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and relationship before naming the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</p>"}], "revisit": "<p>For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير والتأنيث</span>, revisit Lessons 1 and 7. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المثنّى</span> and the forms of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>, revisit Lessons 2–7. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التصغير والنسبة</span>, revisit Lesson 8. For <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدد والمعدود</span>, revisit Lessons 9–12 and compare all the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدود</span> relationships before trying the review again.</p>"};
